  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc591c481a0238_elior%20logo.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "Elior x Innovorder",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <h3>01. The context</h3>\n          <p><strong>The challenge of the project with Elior</strong></p>\n          <p>Elior Enseignement and Innovorder have designed \"<strong>Weeky Connect</strong>\", a <strong>pre-ordering solution</strong><a href=\"/en/blog/benefits-of-online-ordering-for-restaurants\"><strong>online ordering solution</strong></a> implemented at the Lycée St Joseph in Boulogne-sur-Mer. The catering company <a href=\"/en/blog/collective-catering-losses-waste-management\"><strong>catering company</strong></a> is thus relying on the digital revolution to better meet the new expectations of its customers.<br></p>\n          <h3>02. The solution</h3>\n          <p><strong>Discover <em>Weeky Connect</em></strong></p>\n          <p>The online pre-order solution \"Weeky Connect\" is suitable for students who use new technologies on a daily basis.</p>\n          <p>\"The example of the deployment of the catering solution with this application clearly shows that we are meeting a need, and that it simplifies the life of the students, the school administration but also the catering teams\" Philippe Descamps - Head of the St Joseph high school.</p>\n          <p>Students can pre-order their meal via a kiosk, smartphone or computer, with direct visibility on the availability of sandwiches and related products. The result is a <strong>reduction in waiting time</strong> during the lunch break and a better guest experience.<br>In addition, <strong>the kitchen teams gain in efficiency</strong>: they receive the orders in advance and prepare the bagging beforehand.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1920pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f2fcfc5966b719feac_elior-1.jpeg\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <h4><strong>Why did you choose Innovorder?</strong></h4>\n          <p>\"Elior Enseignement wanted to find digital solutions that were innovative and quick to implement. [...] We really appreciated the agility and speed of execution of the startup and all the innovation they were able to offer us with the implementation of this solution\" Steve Attal - Head of digital projects at Elior</p>\n          <p><br></p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1920pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc592bd819ff7a_elior-3.jpeg\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Elior",
